{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01667i7MY6DE1DJphqeBSpGd","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Operation Wolf arcade 1987 stages Communication Setup Jungle Village Powder Magazine Concentration Camp Airport completing stage restores\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://www.arcade-history.com/game/1887/\"},{\"title\":\"www.arcade-history.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.arcade-history.com/game/1887/?o=2\"},{\"title\":\"6112 operation wolf\",\"url\":\"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/6112-operation-wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://www.hardcoregaming101.net/operation-wolf/\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://pixelatedarcade.com/games/operation-wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Lost In Translation/Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://www.exotica.org.uk/wiki/Lost_In_Translation/Operation_Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf 1987 34\",\"url\":\"https://oldgames.sk/en/game/operation-wolf/online\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://cavac.at/cavacopedia/Operation%20Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://vintagearcade.net/?p=7314\"},{\"title\":\"Inside the Arcade: \\\"Operation Wolf\\\" (1987)\",\"url\":\"https://www.superjumpmagazine.com/inside-the-arcade-operation-wolf/\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Operation_Wolf.html\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf (Arcade)\",\"url\":\"https://tcrf.net/Operation_Wolf_(Arcade)\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://Www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"operation wolf\",\"url\":\"https://www.doc.surf/wiki/operation-wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"operation wolf\",\"url\":\"https://www.co-op.gg/dos/game/operation-wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://en.Wikipedia.com/wiki/Operation_Wolf\"},{\"title\":\"Operation Wolf\",\"url\":\"https://kiwix.lema.org/wikipedia_en_all_mini_2024-02/A/Operation_Wolf\"}]\n\nThe search confirms the six stage names but doesn't confirm the stage-completion restore mechanic you asked about.\n\n- **Stages:** One source says the game is divided into six stages: Communication Setup, Jungle, Village, Powder Magazine, Concentration Camp, and Airport. A rail-shooter overview lists the same six stages, and that the goal is to rescue 5 hostages held in a concentration camp (a rail shooter broken up into 6 different stages).\n- **Stage completion:** One source says each stage has a different objective and when successfully completed affects the gameplay on remaining stages. Another says completion of each stage advances the story. Neither source mentions restoring ammo, health, or other resources, so the \"restores\" detail is unverified.\n- **Release date:** Sources differ. One lists the arcade release as JP: July 16, 1987, EU: October 1987, NA: December 1987, while another says Operation Wolf was released in November 1987.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d128962a-bd2b-4da0-bea3-10df26a8e825","uuid":"d782e473-df64-4d0d-ba34-bdcc216c7241","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:54:53.954Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Operation Wolf arcade 1987 stages Communication Setup Jungle Village Powder Magazine Concentration Camp Airport completing stage restores","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018HCkxhDu7HEKiJ4tzWHXrJ","content":[{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://www.arcade-history.com/game/1887/"},{"title":"www.arcade-history.com","url":"https://www.arcade-history.com/game/1887/?o=2"},{"title":"6112 operation wolf","url":"https://gamesdb.launchbox-app.com/games/details/6112-operation-wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://www.hardcoregaming101.net/operation-wolf/"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://pixelatedarcade.com/games/operation-wolf"},{"title":"Lost In Translation/Operation Wolf","url":"https://www.exotica.org.uk/wiki/Lost_In_Translation/Operation_Wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf 1987 34","url":"https://oldgames.sk/en/game/operation-wolf/online"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://cavac.at/cavacopedia/Operation%20Wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://vintagearcade.net/?p=7314"},{"title":"Inside the Arcade: \"Operation Wolf\" (1987)","url":"https://www.superjumpmagazine.com/inside-the-arcade-operation-wolf/"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Operation_Wolf.html"},{"title":"Operation Wolf (Arcade)","url":"https://tcrf.net/Operation_Wolf_(Arcade)"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://Www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf"},{"title":"operation wolf","url":"https://www.doc.surf/wiki/operation-wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Operation_Wolf"},{"title":"operation wolf","url":"https://www.co-op.gg/dos/game/operation-wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://en.Wikipedia.com/wiki/Operation_Wolf"},{"title":"Operation Wolf","url":"https://kiwix.lema.org/wikipedia_en_all_mini_2024-02/A/Operation_Wolf"}]},"The search confirms the six stage names but doesn't confirm the stage-completion restore mechanic you asked about.\n\n- **Stages:** One source says the game is divided into six stages: Communication Setup, Jungle, Village, Powder Magazine, Concentration Camp, and Airport. A rail-shooter overview lists the same six stages, and that the goal is to rescue 5 hostages held in a concentration camp (a rail shooter broken up into 6 different stages).\n- **Stage completion:** One source says each stage has a different objective and when successfully completed affects the gameplay on remaining stages. Another says completion of each stage advances the story. Neither source mentions restoring ammo, health, or other resources, so the \"restores\" detail is unverified.\n- **Release date:** Sources differ. One lists the arcade release as JP: July 16, 1987, EU: October 1987, NA: December 1987, while another says Operation Wolf was released in November 1987."],"durationSeconds":8.926770302999998,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01667i7MY6DE1DJphqeBSpGd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
