{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QEmPfy4B36WcAU3Pi9cCzc","type":"tool_result","content":"34:## The core library\n138:2. **Find** the nearest entry: `node tools/asset-find.mjs \"tavern table\"` searches the core library and the store's sets\n34:## The core library\n35-\n36-**Shapes** (sized for a 26-unit hero; generators take params): barrel, crate, chest, table, chair, stool, bench, bed,\n37-bookcase, shelf, pot, jar, sack, cart, well, sign, lamppost, anvil; fence { len: 16 }, pine { h: 41, tiers: 4 },\n38-tree { h: 40, seed: 1 }, bush { r: 7 }, grass { h: 6, n: 6 }, rock { r: 7.5, seed: 2 }, crystal { h: 18, seed: 1 }.\n39-`r.shape('pine', x, y, 0, { params: { h: 30 } })`; `E.SHAPES.barrel.about` says what each is.\n40-\n41-**Materials:** woods oak walnut birch crate plank planks wood; stones stone cobble marble granite sandstone slate rock\n42-brick flagstone ruin; metals iron steel gold copper bronze metal rusted; clay glazed porcelain; cloth linen burlap wool velvet leather;\n43-plants bark needles leaves shrub moss straw hedge grass; ground dirt sand snow mud; water ice crystal flame bone shingle;\n44-walls timber plaster; tops speckle plain tiles slab; tiles block bonus ground pipe checker.\n45-\n46-## Materials on surfaces\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174746__xe37f55/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d128962a-bd2b-4da0-bea3-10df26a8e825","uuid":"48020531-1b04-4018-acd3-902d9e00142f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:58:59.701Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"34:## The core library\n138:2. **Find** the nearest entry: `node tools/asset-find.mjs \"tavern table\"` searches the core library and the store's sets\n34:## The core library\n35-\n36-**Shapes** (sized for a 26-unit hero; generators take params): barrel, crate, chest, table, chair, stool, bench, bed,\n37-bookcase, shelf, pot, jar, sack, cart, well, sign, lamppost, anvil; fence { len: 16 }, pine { h: 41, tiers: 4 },\n38-tree { h: 40, seed: 1 }, bush { r: 7 }, grass { h: 6, n: 6 }, rock { r: 7.5, seed: 2 }, crystal { h: 18, seed: 1 }.\n39-`r.shape('pine', x, y, 0, { params: { h: 30 } })`; `E.SHAPES.barrel.about` says what each is.\n40-\n41-**Materials:** woods oak walnut birch crate plank planks wood; stones stone cobble marble granite sandstone slate rock\n42-brick flagstone ruin; metals iron steel gold copper bronze metal rusted; clay glazed porcelain; cloth linen burlap wool velvet leather;\n43-plants bark needles leaves shrub moss straw hedge grass; ground dirt sand snow mud; water ice crystal flame bone shingle;\n44-walls timber plaster; tops speckle plain tiles slab; tiles block bonus ground pipe checker.\n45-\n46-## Materials on surfaces","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174746__xe37f55/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QEmPfy4B36WcAU3Pi9cCzc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
