{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Wf7i9VF3AmvanHtFdc3Y2","type":"tool_result","content":"135:- `E.arc(a, b, g, o = {})` †: the throw from a to b ({ x, y, z }) under gravity g (units a second squared, pulling z down): a lob to a teammate's feet, a grenade, a leap to a ledge. o: { apex: how far it rises over the higher end (24), or time: the seconds it flies, or speed: a launch speed (the\n164:- `E.hsl(hh, s, l)`: '#rrggbb' from hue (degrees), saturation and lightness (0..1)\n171:- `E.noise2(x, y)`: smooth value noise 0..1 over the plane (one bump per whole unit): blotches, clouds, wobble\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n839:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n842:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174746__xe37f55/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d128962a-bd2b-4da0-bea3-10df26a8e825","uuid":"5688a78b-66e5-4c63-94ec-58b47d87f724","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:12:27.421Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"135:- `E.arc(a, b, g, o = {})` †: the throw from a to b ({ x, y, z }) under gravity g (units a second squared, pulling z down): a lob to a teammate's feet, a grenade, a leap to a ledge. o: { apex: how far it rises over the higher end (24), or time: the seconds it flies, or speed: a launch speed (the\n164:- `E.hsl(hh, s, l)`: '#rrggbb' from hue (degrees), saturation and lightness (0..1)\n171:- `E.noise2(x, y)`: smooth value noise 0..1 over the plane (one bump per whole unit): blotches, clouds, wobble\n179:- `E.rng(s)`: a seeded random stream: const R = E.rng(42); R() gives 0..1, the same numbers for the same seed (mulberry32)\n839:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n842:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174746__xe37f55/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017Wf7i9VF3AmvanHtFdc3Y2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
